        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Planning Worksheet</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-3">
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Template Details</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Write down: template name, purpose, sending point, recipient, signer or signers.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Content Details</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">List: fixed information, changing information, required fields.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Next Action</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Define the next action after completion: onboarding, scheduling, payment, etc.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Point -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-l-4 border-amber-400">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2">Key Point</h3>
        <p class="text-amber-800 text-lg">The client''s name should become a custom value, not standard legal wording. Every fillable field must have the correct owner so the right person can see and complete it. Legal terms should be reviewed by a qualified attorney before use with clients.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Action Steps -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-emerald-200">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900">Action Steps — Build the Template</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">1</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Complete the Planning Worksheet</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Write down template name, purpose, sending point, recipient, signers, fixed information, changing information, required fields, and next action.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Identify Fixed vs Changing Information</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Review your current document and categorize each piece of information as fixed or changing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">3</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Assign Field Ownership</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">For every action field, clearly identify which signer must complete it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>',
      title = 'Plan the Template Before Building',
      lesson_number = 2,
      sort_order = 2,
      updated_at = NOW()
    WHERE id = v_lesson_id;
    
    RAISE NOTICE 'Updated lesson: Plan the Template Before Building';
  END IF;

END $$;


-- Insert Quiz Questions for Lesson: Plan the Template Before Building

DO $$
DECLARE
  v_module_id UUID;
  v_lesson_id UUID;
  v_quiz_id UUID;
BEGIN
  -- Get Module by week number
  SELECT id INTO v_module_id FROM public.training_modules WHERE week_number = 14 LIMIT 1;
  
  IF v_module_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Module 14 not found';
    RETURN;
  END IF;

  -- Get the lesson ID
  SELECT id INTO v_lesson_id 
  FROM public.lessons 
  WHERE slug = 'plan-template-before-building' AND module_id = v_module_id;
  
  IF v_lesson_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Lesson plan-template-before-building not found in module 14';
    RETURN;
  END IF;
  
  -- Delete existing quizzes to avoid duplicates
  DELETE FROM public.lesson_quizzes WHERE lesson_id = v_lesson_id;


  -- Question 1
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'Which information should become a custom value: standard legal wording or the client''s name?', 
    '["Standard legal wording","The client''s name","Both should be custom values","Neither should be custom values"]'::jsonb,
    'The client''s name',
    'The client''s name is changing information that should be a custom value. Standard legal wording is fixed information that stays the same.', 
    1
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 2
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'Why must each fillable field have the correct owner?', 
    '["To make the document look more professional","The correct person must be able to see and complete the field","To reduce the number of fields in the document","To automatically fill in the field data"]'::jsonb,
    'The correct person must be able to see and complete the field',
    'Field ownership ensures the correct signer receives and can complete their assigned fields. A client should not receive the sender''s signature field.', 
    2
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 3
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'Who should review legal terms before the template is used with clients?', 
    '["The marketing team","A qualified attorney","The sales team","No review is necessary"]'::jsonb,
    'A qualified attorney',
    'A qualified attorney should review all legal terms before templates are used with clients. This module teaches the software process, not legal advice.', 
    3
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;

END $$;
